# Weekly api_logs JSONL export to the research host, then prune >30 days
# iff the copy landed and a fresh S3 database backup exists.
# Runs Monday 06:00 UTC — after Sunday closes and after the 04:00 backup.
#
# !! THIS FILE IS NOT DEPLOYED. !!
# Deploys update ops/db/export-weekly-logs.sh but never touch
# /etc/cron.d/freeinference-export-weekly-logs, which is installed by hand.
# Editing the schedule, the flags, MAILTO or the `|| tail` here changes
# NOTHING in production until someone re-runs the install command below.
#
# Install / update: sudo cp ops/db/export-weekly-logs-cron /etc/cron.d/freeinference-export-weekly-logs
#                   sudo chmod 644 /etc/cron.d/freeinference-export-weekly-logs
# Verify what is actually live: sudo cat /etc/cron.d/freeinference-export-weekly-logs
#
# Runs as jason, not freeinference: the research host is reached with jason's
# ssh key as juncheng@internal.freeinference.org:10021. jason is in the docker
# group (needed by archive-old-logs.sh) and can use the AWS credentials that
# check-backup-health.sh / archive-old-logs.sh need.
#
# The export is streamed over ssh. A week of api_logs cannot safely land on
# the Postgres volume and then be scp'd — that volume is the one the database
# would fill. The remote path is the scp destination:
#   /scratch/juncheng/2026_freeinference_prod/api_logs_$startday_$endday.jsonl.zst
#
# Prune: only after (1) that file verifies on the remote host and (2)
# check-backup-health.sh says the nightly S3 dump is fresh. archive-old-logs.sh
# then writes its own S3 CSV archive and DELETEs rows older than 30 days.
#
# Logs: ~jason/export-weekly-logs.log
# The `|| tail` prints the tail of the log on a failing run only, which is
# what cron mails to MAILTO — a clean run stays silent.

SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin
HOME=/home/jason
MAILTO=juncheng@seas.harvard.edu

0 6 * * 1 jason /srv/hybridInference/ops/db/export-weekly-logs.sh --remote juncheng@internal.freeinference.org --port 10021 --dest-dir /scratch/juncheng/2026_freeinference_prod --s3-archive s3://harvardsys-backup/freeinference/archive/api_logs --retention-days 30 >> /home/jason/export-weekly-logs.log 2>&1 || tail -n 40 /home/jason/export-weekly-logs.log
